The '''sand bridge''' is an earth-type [[Spells|spell]] used to construct a bridge out of sand.{{Ref|m|12|26-27}}

==Description==
The spell is composed of several unrecognizable keystones, the only one known being column. The spell functions by creating a bridge out of the earth, and is used to make temporary bridges until an actual bridge can be constructed.{{Ref|m|12|27}}
[[File:12 26 Sand Bridge.png|thumb|Coco looking at the constructed sand bridge]]
==Usage==
The spell was used by [[Olruggio]] after the [[Stairway River]] disaster had subsided. As the original bridge had collapsed, crossing the river became impossible. To solve this, he created a sand bridge as a temporary fix. Since he was drawing the glyphs on rocks, a normal wand would have been unusable, so he utilized [[Searneedle Wand|searneedle wand]] to etch the glyph into the stone.{{Ref|m|12|27}}
